WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.700
[singing] I'm feeling kinda lonesome

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.580
Haven't slept a wink

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:16.640
I walk the floor

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.100
and watch the door

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:21.580
and in between I drink

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.520
black coffee

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:30.460
Love's a hand me down brew

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.740
I'll never know a Sunday...

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.540
...from this weekday room

